# The sources of SDL 2.32.10 for the Emscripten VM, relative to the src/
# directory of its archive, which cmake/emscripten/deps/sdl2.cmake compiles
# with the configuration next to this file (SDL_config_emscripten.h): the
# 119 that Emscripten's own port of SDL 2.32.10 compiles (the srcs, and the
# generic threads, of upstream/emscripten/tools/ports/sdl2.py of Emscripten
# 6.0.10), and the dummy joystick driver, which that configuration takes
# instead of Emscripten's gamepads.  19 of them compile to nothing there:
# the drivers it leaves out (the audio of Emscripten and the disk audio, the
# joysticks of Emscripten, the OpenGL, GLES and EGL code) and the code of
# other systems (Direct3D, the PSP, the scancode tables of X11 and Wayland,
# the audio devices of the BSDs and OSS, the dynamic API); they are kept so
# that the list stays the port's.
